---

This plugin vendors `sdpi-components` (com.keelan182.lightroom-presets.sdPlugin/ui/sdpi-components.js),
Copyright Corsair Memory Inc. and other contributors (https://sdpi-components.dev),
used under its own MIT-style license as published by that project. Its
license header is preserved at the top of the vendored file.

This project's Lightroom communication layer (src/lightroom/) was written
independently for this plugin. Its design was informed by studying the
publicly available source of adamkarnowka/loupedeck-lightroom-cc (a
third-party Loupedeck plugin for Lightroom Desktop/CC) to understand Adobe's
External Controller API wire protocol - see docs/PROTOCOL.md for exactly
which facts were taken from that research and why no code from that project
was copied. That project's README states it is MIT-licensed, but no LICENSE
file was present in the repository at the time of this review, so no source
code from it has been reused here.
